# Source only: everything is ignored except the build inputs listed below.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!更新内容.txt
!CMakeLists.txt
!build.ps1
!*.cpp
!*.h
!*.asm
!*.def
!docs/title.jpg
!docs/donate.jpg
!docs/BUILD.md
!docs/GAME_UPDATES.md
!docs/PAK_WORKFLOW.md
!scripts/update_port.py
!scripts/make_mount_pak.py
!scripts/gen_boss_effects.py
!scripts/requirements-port.txt
!installer/install.ps1
!installer/Install.bat
!src/env_check/known_exes.cmake
!src/env_check/known_exes.h.in

# Build output, release ZIPs and local notes / scripts / archives stay out of the repository.
build/
build_*/
dist/
local/
# Third-party source drops (OthersChange: an older build someone else edited) are read, never published.
OthersChange/

# Player files stay private. The maintainer explicitly publishes this named example only.
combos/
*.combo
!samples/sampleCombo.combo
!samples/README.md
!tests/installer_sample_test.ps1
!scripts/build_manual.py
!docs/USER_MANUAL.md
!docs/manual_images/*.png
!docs/manual_images/nodes.json
!docs/ANIMATION_PRESETS.md
!docs/WEAPON_DERIVATIONS.md
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
!licenses/UUEPBS-LICENSE-STATUS.txt
# 身材 / 骨骼: the UUEPBS editor and Dear ImGui sources, their notices, and UUEPBS's own three example presets (no animations).
!src/uuepbs/**/*.hpp
!src/uuepbs/**/*.inc
!src/uuepbs/README.md
!licenses/DearImGui-LICENSE.txt
!samples/UUEPBS Presets/*.json
!docs/SOFT_BONES.md
!docs/PLUGIN_API.md
!docs/AGENT_PLUGIN_GUIDE.md
!sdk/samples/CMakeLists.txt
!sdk/samples/weapon_actions/pbz_weapon_actions.txt
# 派生插件 Lua scripts (interface revision 3): Lua 5.4.7's C sources, lua.hpp, its licence, and the sample scripts.
!src/third_party/lua/src/*.c
!src/third_party/lua/include/*.hpp
!src/third_party/lua/LICENSE
!licenses/Lua-LICENSE.txt
!sdk/samples/lua/*.lua
# Project licence (MIT) and the entry points for agents (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md imports it) and the architecture doc.
!LICENSE
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!docs/ARCHITECTURE.md
